    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        MoME: <span class="search-hit mathjax">Mixture</span> of Visual Language Medical <span class="search-hit mathjax">Experts</span> for Medical Imaging Segmentation
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Rezvani%2C+A">Arghavan Rezvani</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yan%2C+X">Xiangyi Yan</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wu%2C+A+T">Anthony T. Wu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Han%2C+K">Kun Han</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Khosravi%2C+P">Pooya Khosravi</a>, 
      
