        <span class="search-hit mathjax">Test</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">time</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">reward</span>-guided alignment of language <span class="search-hit mathjax">models</span> by importance sampling on pre-logit <span class="search-hit mathjax">space</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
