        PaTaRM: Bridging Pairwise and Pointwise Signals via <span class="search-hit mathjax">Preference</span>-Aware Task-Adaptive <span class="search-hit mathjax">Reward</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Modeling</span>
      
