    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        MedAlign: A Synergistic Framework of Multimodal <span class="search-hit mathjax">Preference</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Optimization</span> and Federated Meta-Cognitive Reasoning
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
